---
title: "share_object (Sui Framework: transfer)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_new: object must be created in current transaction
    q_check_new --> q_abort: not newly created
    q_abort --> [*]: abort ESharedNonNewObject
    q_check_new --> q_share: newly created object
    q_share --> [*]: share_object_impl(obj) - object becomes shared

    note right of q_check_new
        INV-001: only newly created objects can be shared (prevents re-sharing)
        INV-002: sharing is irreversible - cannot convert back to owned
        INV-003: share_object() restricted to defining module (bytecode verifier)
        INV-004: public_share_object() requires key + store
    end note
